    # KYLISA @ talk "You have returned... How may I help you?"
    KYLISA @ talk "Você retornou... Como posso ajudá-lo?"

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:42
translate ptBR kylisa_bye_9bb97fc5:

    # KYLISA @ talk "May the blessings of the gods be with you."
    KYLISA @ talk "Que as bênçãos dos deuses estejam com você."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:46
translate ptBR kylisa_whoareyou_52dd919a:

    # KYLISA @ talk "I am the royal Mage, but given the... {i}change in leadership,{/i}"
    KYLISA @ talk "Eu sou o Mago real, mas dado a... {i}mudança na liderança,{/i}"

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:47
translate ptBR kylisa_whoareyou_e97fcb71:

    # KYLISA @ talk "I now serve at the Emperor's pleasure."
    KYLISA @ talk "Agora sirvo ao bel-prazer do Imperador."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:50
translate ptBR kylisa_whoareyou_d2173e34:

    # KYLISA @ angry "You should be careful asking such questions..."
    KYLISA @ angry "Você deveria ter cuidado ao fazer tais perguntas..."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:51
translate ptBR kylisa_whoareyou_32ed9419:

    # KYLISA @ angry "One could take that question the wrong way."
    KYLISA @ angry "Alguém poderia interpretar essa pergunta de forma errada."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:52
translate ptBR kylisa_whoareyou_b11273ac:

    # MC @ talk "Forgive me, I did not mean any ill with it."
    MC @ talk "Perdoe-me, não tive má intenção com isso."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:53
translate ptBR kylisa_whoareyou_94c63cb9:

    # KYLISA @ sad "...He was kinder."
    KYLISA @ sad "...Ele era mais gentil."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:54
translate ptBR kylisa_whoareyou_037383db:

    # KYLISA @ sad "Most talk of how Alcott saved us all and Mesamore would have doomed us all."
    KYLISA @ sad "A maioria fala de como Alcott nos salvou e Mesamore teria nos condenado."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:55
translate ptBR kylisa_whoareyou_badfec21:

    # KYLISA @ sad "But many forget how we prospered under Mesamore before."
    KYLISA @ sad "Mas muitos esquecem como prosperamos sob Mesamore antes."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:56
translate ptBR kylisa_whoareyou_676e62d6:

    # KYLISA @ sad "He was a kind king, one determined to tackle poverty in ways his predecessors never did, and life was good under him."
    KYLISA @ sad "Ele foi um rei bondoso, determinado a combater a pobreza de maneiras que seus antecessores nunca fizeram, e a vida sob seu governo era boa."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:57
translate ptBR kylisa_whoareyou_e9272224:

    # KYLISA @ sad "He may not he been the strongest military mind, but what king could have ever been prepared for the threat of the Demorai in such short notice?"
    KYLISA @ sad "Ele pode não ter sido a mente militar mais forte, mas que rei poderia ter estado preparado para a ameaça dos Demorai em tão curto prazo?"

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:58
translate ptBR kylisa_whoareyou_86eb7477:

    # KYLISA @ talk "Alcott tried time and time again to push for more control over the lives of the realms citizens, and each time, Mesamore pushed back."
    KYLISA @ talk "Alcott tentou repetidamente pressionar por mais controle sobre a vida dos cidadãos do reino, e cada vez, Mesamore recuou."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:59
translate ptBR kylisa_whoareyou_66935207:

    # KYLISA @ talk "Despite the war he faced, Mesamore always wanted us to see a future beyond it, he never wanted the realm to become nothing but the violent war machine it is today."
    KYLISA @ talk "Apesar da guerra que enfrentou, Mesamore sempre quis que víssemos um futuro além dela, nunca quis que o reino se tornasse nada além da máquina de guerra violenta que é hoje."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:60
translate ptBR kylisa_whoareyou_c2947f18:

    # KYLISA @ sad "Now? We are all just expendable pieces for a meat grinder as we fight inch by inch for every piece of land."
    KYLISA @ sad "Agora? Somos todos peças descartáveis para um moedor de carne enquanto lutamos centímetro por centímetro por cada pedaço de terra."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:61
translate ptBR kylisa_whoareyou_bd6b1af1:

    # KYLISA @ talk "There are no names remembered anymore when it comes to the war council, just numbers... Numbers thrown against other numbers."
    KYLISA @ talk "Não há mais nomes lembrados quando se trata do conselho de guerra, apenas números... Números lançados contra outros números."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:62
translate ptBR kylisa_whoareyou_36931427:

    # MC @ talk "But did we have any other choice?"
    MC @ talk "Mas tínhamos outra escolha?"

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:63
translate ptBR kylisa_whoareyou_5d28ca3c:

    # KYLISA @ talk "In stopping the war? No... I feel that it was inevitable."
    KYLISA @ talk "Em parar a guerra? Não... sinto que era inevitável."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:64
translate ptBR kylisa_whoareyou_e82d8ab8:

    # KYLISA @ angry "In what we've {i}become{/i} trying to win this war? Absolutely."
    KYLISA @ angry "No que nós nos {i}tornamos{/i} tentando vencer esta guerra? Absolutamente."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:66
translate ptBR kylisa_whoareyou_f9be3333:

    # KYLISA @ talk "Speak your mind."
    KYLISA @ talk "Fale o que pensa."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:73
translate ptBR kylisa_blessing_2e104e0a:

    # "Kylisa paused for a moment, then replied calmly:"
    "Kylisa fez uma pausa por um momento, então respondeu calmamente:"

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:74
translate ptBR kylisa_blessing_c2d9f055:

    # KYLISA @ talk "The gods seem to already stand by your side, [player_name!t]."
    KYLISA @ talk "Os deuses parecem já estar ao seu lado, [player_name!t]."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:81
translate ptBR kylisa_cleansing_12864e63:

    # KYLISA @ talk "The old or the new?"
    KYLISA @ talk "Os antigos ou os novos?"

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:82
translate ptBR kylisa_cleansing_1d31c4e5:

    # MC @ talk "Whoever will listen."
    MC @ talk "Quem quiser ouvir."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:83
translate ptBR kylisa_cleansing_afaa155c:

    # KYLISA @ talk "I may grant you their blessing..."
    KYLISA @ talk "Posso conceder a você a bênção deles..."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:84
translate ptBR kylisa_cleansing_2ac6342c:

    # "She raised her head a bit, and from beneath her hood I saw a pair of glaring eyes, scanning into the very depths of my soul."
    "Ela ergueu um pouco a cabeça, e de baixo de seu capuz eu vi um par de olhos penetrantes, examinando as profundezas da minha alma."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:85
translate ptBR kylisa_cleansing_83721d0b:

    # "A gentle, barely-noticeable pulse of energy waved through my entire body, followed by a harsh, painful jitter:"
    "Um pulso suave, quase imperceptível, de energia ondulou por todo o meu corpo, seguido por um choque severo e doloroso:"

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:86
translate ptBR kylisa_cleansing_28a75444:

    # BLACK "{b}THAT'S CLOSE ENOUGH.{/b}"
    BLACK "{b}ISSO É SUFICIENTE.{/b}"

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:87
translate ptBR kylisa_cleansing_9dfd0bef:

    # "Kylisa took half-a step back and murmured to herself:"
    "Kylisa deu meio passo para trás e murmurou para si mesma:"

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:88
translate ptBR kylisa_cleansing_3b48ba2d:

    # KYLISA @ talk "That energy... It is not Demorai, yet so strong..."
    KYLISA @ talk "Essa energia... Não é Demorai, mas é tão forte..."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:89
translate ptBR kylisa_cleansing_f9a3b82b:

    # "She recomposed herself and concluded:"
    "Ela se recompôs e concluiu:"

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:90
translate ptBR kylisa_cleansing_f6b8311c:

    # KYLISA @ talk "I don't know what exactly you came in contact with, [player_name!t], but I might be able to help."
    KYLISA @ talk "Não sei exatamente com o que você entrou em contato, [player_name!t], mas talvez eu possa ajudar."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:91
translate ptBR kylisa_cleansing_e98a2fd8:

    # KYLISA @ talk "I believe I can douse this... black flame that is devouring your soul."
    KYLISA @ talk "Acredito que posso apagar esta... chama negra que está devorando sua alma."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:92
translate ptBR kylisa_cleansing_cdf02e73:

    # "I gulped at the 'devouring' part."
    "Engoli em seco com a parte de 'devorar'."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:93
translate ptBR kylisa_cleansing_df3a112b:

    # KYLISA @ talk "I can only do so much as to set back it's {i}progress{/i}."
    KYLISA @ talk "Só posso fazer o suficiente para retardar seu {i}progresso{/i}."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:94
translate ptBR kylisa_cleansing_d7f274bb:

    # KYLISA @ talk "Five hundred coin."
    KYLISA @ talk "Quinhentas moedas."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:97
translate ptBR kylisa_cleansing_1d60de78:

    # KYLISA @ talk "I can help you douse the black flame, [player_name!t]."
    KYLISA @ talk "Posso ajudá-lo a apagar a chama negra, [player_name!t]."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:98
translate ptBR kylisa_cleansing_38174cec:

    # KYLISA @ talk "You should seek a more... permanent solution though, for I can see the flame leaving it's scorching marks on your soul as we speak."
    KYLISA @ talk "Mas você deve buscar uma solução mais... permanente, pois posso ver a chama deixando marcas ardentes em sua alma enquanto falamos."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:99
translate ptBR kylisa_cleansing_d7f274bb_1:

    # KYLISA @ talk "Five hundred coin."
    KYLISA @ talk "Quinhentas moedas."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:101
translate ptBR kylisa_cleansing_4f3629c4:

    # KYLISA @ talk "I cannot do this again, [player_name!t]."
    KYLISA @ talk "Não posso fazer isso de novo, [player_name!t]."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:102
translate ptBR kylisa_cleansing_9e0beb61:

    # KYLISA @ talk "I need to regain my strength."
    KYLISA @ talk "Preciso recuperar minhas forças."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:103
translate ptBR kylisa_cleansing_70884999:

    # KYLISA @ talk "Come find me tomorrow, I will help you with your... condition."
    KYLISA @ talk "Venha me encontrar amanhã, eu o ajudarei com sua... condição."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:104
translate ptBR kylisa_cleansing_6188caea:

    # MC @ talk "I see."
    MC @ talk "Entendo."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:110
translate ptBR kylisa_cleansing_27517054:

    # "Pain began to quickly consume my body just as Kylisa raised her staff and pointed it at me:"
    "A dor começou a consumir rapidamente meu corpo justo quando Kylisa ergueu seu cajado e o apontou para mim:"

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:118
translate ptBR kylisa_cleansing_2a9f7495:

    # KYLISA @ talk "It is done."
    KYLISA @ talk "Está feito."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:119
translate ptBR kylisa_cleansing_700ec46a:

    # "Feeling refreshed and... in control again, I exhaled."
    "Me sentindo revigorado e... no controle novamente, expirei."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:120
translate ptBR kylisa_cleansing_ec3d2f8f:

    # MC @ talk "Thanks, Kylisa."
    MC @ talk "Obrigado, Kylisa."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:121
translate ptBR kylisa_cleansing_3b24004c:

    # KYLISA @ talk "It is my pleasure, [player_name!t]."
    KYLISA @ talk "É um prazer, [player_name!t]."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:124
translate ptBR kylisa_cleansing_51095b9f:

    # KYLISA @ talk "Very well."
    KYLISA @ talk "Muito bem."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:128
translate ptBR kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_585e28d8:

    # KYLISA @ talk "One would hope your education would have taught you this already."
    KYLISA @ talk "Seria de se esperar que sua educação já lhe tivesse ensinado isso."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:129
translate ptBR kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_47f46502:

    # MC @ talk "It has been some time since I last read the holy text... I could do with a refresher."
    MC @ talk "Faz algum tempo desde a última vez que li o texto sagrado... Seria bom dar uma revisada."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:130
translate ptBR kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_4913f092:

    # KYLISA @ talk "Very well, what do you wish to know about?"
    KYLISA @ talk "Muito bem, sobre o que você deseja saber?"

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:133
translate ptBR kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_fd8d020e:

    # KYLISA @ talk "In the beginning, Al'Vazah, the great creator, formed the old gods and gave them dominion across the stars."
    KYLISA @ talk "No princípio, Al'Vazah, o grande criador, formou os deuses antigos e deu-lhes domínio sobre as estrelas."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:134
translate ptBR kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_82262e83:

    # KYLISA @ talk "As life flourished, the old gods grew accustomed to their worship, and saw themselves as higher beings who became obsessed with their own power games against each other."
    KYLISA @ talk "À medida que a vida florescia, os deuses antigos se acostumaram à sua adoração e passaram a se ver como seres superiores, obcecados por seus próprios jogos de poder uns contra os outros."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:135
translate ptBR kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_3f1a19fe:

    # KYLISA @ talk "The old gods would often toy with those they viewed as lesser beings, and could only be roused to help with the offer of bargains and sacrifices."
    KYLISA @ talk "Os deuses antigos frequentemente brincavam com aqueles que consideravam seres inferiores, e só podiam ser motivados a ajudar mediante ofertas de barganhas e sacrifícios."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:136
translate ptBR kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_d2783f91:

    # KYLISA @ talk "Al'Vazah, displeased with what had become of the old gods, formed the new gods and also gave them powerful dominions to rule across the stars."
    KYLISA @ talk "Al'Vazah, descontente com o que havia se tornado os deuses antigos, formou os novos deuses e também lhes deu poderosos domínios para governar sobre as estrelas."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:137
translate ptBR kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_581b3849:

    # KYLISA @ talk "The new gods in contrast, believed it was their duty to guide the mortal races to a higher state of being."
    KYLISA @ talk "Os novos deuses, em contraste, acreditavam que era seu dever guiar as raças mortais a um estado superior de existência."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:138
translate ptBR kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_7964fec4:

    # KYLISA @ talk "They openly chose to walk amongst us, and pull back the veil of secrecy that the old gods always maintained."
    KYLISA @ talk "Eles escolheram abertamente caminhar entre nós, e remover o véu de segredo que os deuses antigos sempre mantiveram."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:139
translate ptBR kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_b4f9b1d2:

    # KYLISA @ talk "Threatened, the old gods battled the new gods for supremacy in a great war we now know as the first war of the gods."
    KYLISA @ talk "Ameaçados, os deuses antigos lutaram contra os novos deuses pela supremacia em uma grande guerra que hoje conhecemos como a primeira guerra dos deuses."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:140
translate ptBR kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_69aae19d:

    # KYLISA @ talk "The new gods emerged victorious, led Al'Vazah's champion and the most powerful of all the gods, Tzenvachican."
    KYLISA @ talk "Os novos deuses saíram vitoriosos, liderados pelo campeão de Al'Vazah e o mais poderoso de todos os deuses, Tzenvachican."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:141
translate ptBR kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_2257425a:

    # KYLISA @ talk "The old gods agreed to an uneasy truce talk, their dominion greatly reduced as the new gods triumphed over them."
    KYLISA @ talk "Os velhos deuses concordaram em uma trégua desconfortável, seu domínio bastante reduzido à medida que os novos deuses triunfavam sobre eles."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:142
translate ptBR kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_7cf2ca4a:

    # KYLISA @ talk "And thus began the longest long golden age of history till Malakai's war."
    KYLISA @ talk "E assim começou a mais longa era dourada da história até a guerra de Malakai."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:145
translate ptBR kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_9b93dd68:

    # KYLISA @ talk "Over at least ten thousand years had passed since the end of the first War of the gods."
    KYLISA @ talk "Pelo menos dez mil anos se passaram desde o fim da primeira Guerra dos deuses."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:146
translate ptBR kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_83ff4786:

    # KYLISA @ talk "It is said, the uneasy peace between the old gods and the new had become more strenuous than ever, as the old gods had begun to rally around their own Champion, Shal'krin who they saw might restore them to former glory."
    KYLISA @ talk "Diz-se que a paz instável entre os velhos deuses e os novos tornou-se mais tensa do que nunca, pois os velhos deuses começaram a se unir em torno de seu próprio Campeão, Shal'krin, que eles viam como aquele que poderia restaurá-los à antiga glória."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:147
translate ptBR kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_ca20eac1:

    # KYLISA @ talk "But it was not Shal'Krin who bought about the second war of the gods."
    KYLISA @ talk "Mas não foi Shal'Krin quem provocou a segunda guerra dos deuses."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:148
translate ptBR kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_87e758b6:

    # KYLISA @ talk "Malakai the curious and kind, was decieved by the goddess of chaos, Gimera, that the only way to prevent the coming war was to open the Necronimis, a ancient box formed and sealed away by Al'Vazah at the start of his great creation."
    KYLISA @ talk "Malakai, o curioso e bondoso, foi enganado pela deusa do caos, Gimera, que lhe disse que a única forma de evitar a guerra vindoura era abrir o Necronimis, uma caixa ancestral formada e selada por Al'Vazah no início de sua grande criação."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:149
translate ptBR kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_0330a784:

    # KYLISA @ talk "Malakai opened the box hoping to learn the knowledge inside and use it for good, but instead, he absorbed all the darkness and evils of life itself."
    KYLISA @ talk "Malakai abriu a caixa esperando aprender o conhecimento que havia dentro e usá-lo para o bem, mas, em vez disso, absorveu toda a escuridão e os males da própria vida."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:150
translate ptBR kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_05c3b3b7:

    # KYLISA @ talk "Reborn as Malakai the deciever, the dark shifter, the prince of blood and the lord of darkness."
    KYLISA @ talk "Renascido como Malakai, o enganador, o transmorfo sombrio, o príncipe do sangue e o senhor das trevas."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:151
translate ptBR kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_edff8c10:

    # KYLISA @ talk "Malakai overthrew Shal'Krin and declared himself god of gods, declaring war against Al'Vazah and Tzenvachian."
    KYLISA @ talk "Malakai derrubou Shal'Krin e declarou-se deus dos deuses, declarando guerra contra Al'Vazah e Tzenvachian."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:152
translate ptBR kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_707d5d08:

    # KYLISA @ talk "Both old and new gods become factioned within themselves, taking sides either with Tzenvachian's forces or with Malakai's."
    KYLISA @ talk "Tanto os velhos quanto os novos deuses se dividiram em facções internas, tomando partido ou pelas forças de Tzenvachian ou pelas de Malakai."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:153
translate ptBR kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_469a5e24:

    # KYLISA @ talk "Brother slew brother, and old enemies now found themselves fighting shoulder to shoulder."
    KYLISA @ talk "Irmão matou irmão, e velhos inimigos agora se encontraram lutando lado a lado."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:154
translate ptBR kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_b06b04db:

    # KYLISA @ talk "Some followed Malakai out of fear, while others, genuinely believed in the warped vision of the mad god that he alone could bring about the {i}perfect{/i} world."
    KYLISA @ talk "Alguns seguiram Malakai por medo, enquanto outros, genuinamente acreditavam na visão distorcida do deus louco de que apenas ele poderia trazer o mundo {i}perfeito{/i}."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:155
translate ptBR kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_a4c8291c:

    # KYLISA @ talk "While little is fully understood of what happened next, we know that thousands of mortal races joined the great war, and world upon world was engulfed in flames."
    KYLISA @ talk "Embora pouco se entenda completamente sobre o que aconteceu em seguida, sabemos que milhares de raças mortais se juntaram à grande guerra, e mundo após mundo foi engolido pelas chamas."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:156
translate ptBR kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_e1af33ed:

    # KYLISA @ talk "The gods that had once flourished, were decimated, until finally, Malakai himself faced off with Tzenvachian."
    KYLISA @ talk "Os deuses que outrora floresceram, foram dizimados, até que finalmente o próprio Malakai enfrentou Tzenvachian."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:157
translate ptBR kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_f08591e2:

    # KYLISA @ talk "There battle, as it was written, is beyond our comprehension, but the result seems to be that Malakai's physical form was destroyed at the cost of both Tzenvachian sacrificing himself by trapping their souls in some eternal battle."
    KYLISA @ talk "Sua batalha, como foi escrita, está além da nossa compreensão, mas o resultado parece ser que a forma física de Malakai foi destruída ao custo de ambos Tzenvachian se sacrificarem ao prender suas almas em alguma batalha eterna."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:158
translate ptBR kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_4abad51c:

    # KYLISA @ talk "Thus ending the second war of the gods."
    KYLISA @ talk "Assim terminando a segunda guerra dos deuses."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:161
translate ptBR kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_37a59d9c:

    # KYLISA @ talk "Hmm, not much is written on this part."
    KYLISA @ talk "Hmm, não há muito escrito sobre esta parte."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:162
translate ptBR kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_a03c6b89:

    # KYLISA @ talk "Only the passing words of troubled surviving gods who have, throughout the ages, passed through our world and alluded to what happened."
    KYLISA @ talk "Apenas as palavras passageiras de deuses sobreviventes perturbados que, ao longo das eras, passaram pelo nosso mundo e aludiram ao que aconteceu."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:163
translate ptBR kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_372845a7:

    # KYLISA @ talk "But it's... difficult to always decipher their meaning."
    KYLISA @ talk "Mas é... difícil sempre decifrar o significado deles."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:164
translate ptBR kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_b323444e:

    # MC @ talk "What do you mean?"
    MC @ talk "O que você quer dizer?"

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:165
translate ptBR kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_af75ed5d:

    # KYLISA @ talk "Do keep in mind, much of this is heavily debated by scholars and such, I cannot speak from official doctrine when I discuss it."
    KYLISA @ talk "Tenha em mente que muito disso é fortemente debatido por estudiosos e tal, não posso falar com base em doutrina oficial quando discuto isso."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:166
translate ptBR kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_5bae4f2d:

    # KYLISA @ talk "From the various legends and smaller texts I have gathered, some of the scarred surviving gods explained that the old wars were fought with 'mechanical dragons that surfed the stars' and other such strange things."
    KYLISA @ talk "Das várias lendas e textos menores que reuni, alguns dos deuses sobreviventes e marcados explicaram que as antigas guerras foram travadas com 'dragões mecânicos que surfavam as estrelas' e outras coisas estranhas assim."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:167
translate ptBR kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_9c944004:

    # KYLISA @ talk "These dragons they struggled to feed in the aftermath of the war, and as food and other resources dwindled, they fought amongst each other for what very little remained."
    KYLISA @ talk "Esses dragões que eles lutavam para alimentar no rescaldo da guerra, e à medida que comida e outros recursos diminuíam, eles brigaram entre si pelo pouco que restava."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:168
translate ptBR kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_0132bbc2:

    # KYLISA @ talk "Apparently it was the darkest of times..."
    KYLISA @ talk "Aparentemente, foram os tempos mais sombrios..."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:169
translate ptBR kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_48a85e92:

    # "Kylisa smiled."
    "Kylisa sorriu."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:170
translate ptBR kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_1f4113f5:

    # KYLISA @ smile "We don't know for sure about that part."
    KYLISA @ smile "Não sabemos ao certo sobre essa parte."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:171
translate ptBR kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_828e0014:

    # KYLISA @ smile "Mechanical dragons flying through the stars... What a strange idea."
    KYLISA @ smile "Dragões mecânicos voando pelas estrelas... Que ideia estranha."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:172
translate ptBR kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_9b93778a:

    # KYLISA @ smile "I do wonder sometimes what the gods could have meant by that."
    KYLISA @ smile "Às vezes me pergunto o que os deuses poderiam ter querido dizer com isso."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:175
translate ptBR kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_ea6b7d7e:

    # KYLISA @ talk "As you wish."
    KYLISA @ talk "Como desejar."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:176
translate ptBR kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_ff8a948b:

    # KYLISA @ talk "Anything else?"
    KYLISA @ talk "Mais alguma coisa?"

